     A*
     A*  EDI Witness file
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PE001                     TEXT('Witness')
     A*
     A            E0CO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            E0FND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            E0FYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            E0CASE    R               REFFLD(CASE)
     A            E0LGSQ    R               REFFLD(A50)
     A                                      TEXT('EDI Log sequence #')
     A*
     A            E0NAME    R               REFFLD(DS40)
     A                                      TEXT('Witness name')
     A            E0PHN#    R               REFFLD(DS15)
     A                                      TEXT('Witness business phone')
     A*
     A            E0USER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('LAST' 'MAINTENANCE' 'USER')
     A            E0PGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('LAST' 'MAINTENANCE' 'PGM')
     A            E0DT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('LAST' 'MAINTENANCE' 'DATE')
     A            E0TIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('LAST' 'MAINTENANCE' 'TIME')
